{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26045","headline":"寄张十七校书李仁行秀才 · 鲍溶","name":"寄张十七校书李仁行秀才","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"去年八月此佳辰，池上闲闲四五人。\n久行月影愁迷梦，误入华光笑认春。\n一与清风上芸阁，再期秋雨过龙津。\n今年此日何由见，蓬户萧条对病身。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"鲍溶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26045.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26045","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}